  "problems": "The jeans SIZE CONVERSION table lists letter 'SX' for size 25, almost certainly a typo for XS; copied as published. EU 36 maps to both 26 and 27, 38 to 28 and 29, 42 to 31 and 32. Jeans run only 25-32 on this guide. No inseam table is published (a generic HOW TO MEASURE note defines inseam only). The HOW TO MEASURE block uses the word 'width' ('Waist width: Measured at the narrowest part of the waist'), which could read as garment, but the tables sit under a 'BODY MEASUREMENT' heading, so body was recorded."
